OL,3,CBoy from Romford suffered brain injury
OL,4,Cand drowned on holiday, inquest told
OL,6,FA seven-year-old boy drowned off an
OL,7,FEssex beach and suffered a fatal brain
OL,8,Finjury while on holiday with his
OL,9,Ffamily, a coroner has heard.
OL,11,FMusa Ahmed died six days after getting
OL,12,Finto difficulty in the water in West
OL,13,FMersea on July 22.
OL,15,FHis cousin Sameeha Rahman, 15, and her
OL,16,Fmother Shelina Rahman, 41, both from
OL,17,FIlford in east London, also died in
OL,18,Fthe incident.
