OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F377A1786969103
OL,3,CBoy from Romford suffered brain injury
OL,4,Cand drowned on holiday, inquest told
OL,6,FMusa, from Romford in Essex, was
OL,7,Fbrought to shore, stabilised and then
OL,8,Fflown to the Royal London Hospital
OL,9,Fbefore he died on July 28, the opening
OL,10,Fof an inquest into the deaths heard on
OL,11,FThursday.
OL,13,FThe hearing at Chelmsford County Hall
OL,14,Fwas told the trio had been on a family
OL,15,Fholiday at the time and that post-
OL,16,Fmortem examinations had given a
OL,17,Fprovisional cause of death as drowning
OL,18,Ffor all three.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/4
