CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F377A1786969103
OL,3,CBoy from Romford suffered brain injury
OL,4,Cand drowned on holiday, inquest told
OL,6,FFor Musa, hypoxic ischaemic brain
OL,7,Finjury was also recorded as a
OL,8,Fprovisional cause of death.
OL,10,FSenior coroner for Essex Lincoln
OL,11,FBrookes said: "Clearly it is so tragic
OL,12,Fto come across any death of any
OL,13,Findividual, but when three occur at
OL,14,Fthe same time and of the same family,
OL,15,Fone cannot underestimate the tragic
OL,16,Fnature of such an incident."
OL,18,FMr Brookes offered his "deepest
OL,19,Fcondolences" to the family, friends
OL,20,Fand loved ones of the victims.
