OL,3,CBoy from Romford suffered brain injury
OL,4,Cand drowned on holiday, inquest told
OL,6,FEssex Police previously said officers
OL,7,Fwere called by the ambulance service
OL,8,Fat 5.35pm on July 22 after reports
OL,9,Fthat several people had got into
OL,10,Fdifficulty in the water near Seaview
OL,11,FAvenue.
OL,13,FThe coroner adjourned the inquest to
OL,14,FJanuary 19, 2027.
